          "outputSchema": null,
          "description_hash": "sha256:d9a948d07e2e31572b0029ebab4cbf1281930f04d8abb9ef077d930891191e61"
        },
        {
          "name": "get_japanese_calendar",
          "canonical_hash": "sha256:17d8a27122388c7b97dadc81e9e925082102d2e226d769598957009e33b92f67",
          "description": "日本の暦情報を取得します。指定した日付の六曜（大安・仏滅等）、\n暦注（一粒万倍日・天赦日・不成就日等）、干支、二十四節気を返します。\nさらに、結婚式・引っ越し・建築着工・開業などの用途別に\nその日が吉か凶かの判定とアドバイスも返します。\n\n使用場面:\n- 「今日は大安？」「明日の六曜は？」\n- 「11月15日に結婚式はどう？」\n- 「来週の一粒万倍日はいつ？」\n- 「今日は何か縁起が良い日？」\n\nReturns Japanese calendar information including Rokuyo (six-day cycle fortune),\nRekichu (auspicious/inauspicious day indicators like Ichiryumanbaibi and Tenshanichi),\nKanshi (sexagenary cycle), and Nijushi Sekki (24 solar terms).\nAlso provides context-aware fortune judgments for events like weddings,\nconstruction starts, business openings, and more.",
          "is_mutating": false,
          "property_keys": [
            "categories",
            "date"
          ],
          "required_keys": [],
          "parameter_types": {
            "date": "string",
            "categories": "array"
          },
          "inputSchema": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "date": {
                "type": "string",
                "description": "日付 (YYYY-MM-DD形式)"
              },
              "categories": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "enum": [
                    "wedding",
                    "funeral",
                    "moving",
                    "construction",
                    "business",
                    "car_delivery",
                    "marriage_registration",
                    "travel"
                  ],
                  "type": "string"
                },
                "description": "吉凶判定カテゴリ（省略時は全カテゴリ）"
              }
            }
          },
          "outputSchema": null,
          "description_hash": "sha256:5aa4c4c6db53e3780df7363fe7d6233a884ac812bb9fefb2b1faae4b2609a395"
        }
      ],
